<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3216] Need to deduplicate addresses registered in the IP finder</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3216</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteUtils.toSocketAddresses(...)&lt;/tt&gt; method can produce the collection with duplicated addresses in some cases (e.g., if one of hostnames is provided as an IP). We should deduplicate the list before returning it (most likely we should simply use &lt;tt&gt;Set&lt;/tt&gt; instead).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12974034">IGNITE-3216</key>
            <summary>Need to deduplicate addresses registered in the IP finder</summary>
